            "en-US": "Starting from 08:30 on May 11, the response latency of the dedicated line from Shenzhen to Guangzhou surged from an average of 12ms to 320ms, access to the core trading system in the Guangzhou data center became very slow, and the trading interfaces of the counter and mobile banking frequently report \"connection timeout\". OSS-side event sequence number: event-id-20260511-09013."
          }
        },
        "llm": {
          "script": [
